body:
@hueachilles I think that we can just make it go to plain/undecorated view with a simple query parameter.
`/terms?view=plain`

Was there a reason you had to implement it in a separate component?

I worked through the four items in this issue and have a draft on my fork: https://github.com/kvnloo/crisiscleanup-4-web/pull/1

The draft:
- counts unique `case_number` values instead of assigned work types;
- uses the same unique-case count for `Manage Cases`;
- replaces the fixed `300px` table height with a viewport-responsive height;
- re-fetches the current team + claimed worksites after assignment/removal;
- fixes the parent refresh helper so `await getClaimedWorksites()` actually waits for the API request.

Keeping this draft pending an interactive UI check and CI.
